Benny is a human child of nine in [[Org/Iconoclasm/index|Iconoclasm]], serious beyond his years and hard to one-up. He carries a heavy pick he calls an exemplar weapon, an aspect of himself. He keeps company with [[People/Johnny|Johnny Skyfall]] and [[People/Anzu|Anzu]].

He was killed in the attack on the [[Org/Roundhat Gang/index|Roundhat Gang]] at [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/The Crowded Flea|the Crowded Flea]]. He came back, but left a piece of himself behind in the [[Pharos]] to be fetched later, and now bears Aut's hidden mark. He means to kill the half-giant [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Hlarf|Hlarf]] to honor [[People/Argyle|Argyle]].
